<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">Haggai</book>
  <para style="h">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Haggai</para>
  <para style="mt">Haggai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Daria lal kum hnihna, a thla rukna, chumi thla ni hmasa berah chuan, zâwlnei Hagaia kuta Lalpa thu chu: Sealtiela fapa Judai ram awptu Zerubabela hnênah leh Jehozadaka fapa puithiam lalber Josua hnênah a lo thleng a, heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘Hêng mite hian, “ Lalpa in sak hun tûr chu a lo la thleng lo ve,” an ti e,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei Hagaia kutah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“He in hi a ram reng laia nangni, in chung thuah neitea in chên hi a hun em ni?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah zawng Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In kawngte chu chhût ngun rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam tak in chîng a, tlêm tê in seng si; in ei a, in tlai si lo; in in a, in kham si lo; in sin a, in lum chuang si lo; inhlawhfa chuan ip pawpa thlâk atân mai a hlawh a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In kawngte chu chhût ngun rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlângah kal chho ula, thing han la ula, in chu sa rawh u; chu chu ka lâwm ang a, chawimawiin ka awm ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hmuh ṭeuh in beisei a, ngai teh u, tlêm tê a lo ni; inah in rawn thlen a, ka lo chhêm bo va. Eng vâng nge ni?” tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni. “Nangni mahni in lam pan ṭheuhva in tlân haw thuai ṭhina, ka in chu a ram dêr avâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan vânin daifîm tla tûr a hrênsak che u a, lei chuan a rah a hrênsak bawk che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lei chungah te, tlâng chungah te, buh chungah te, uain chungah te, hriak chungah te, lei aṭanga thil lo chhuak chungah te, mihring chungah te, ran chungah te, kuta thawh chhuah zawng zawng chungah te khua ka tikhêng a ni e.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela leh Jehozadaka fapa puithiam lalber Josua leh mi la awm chhun zawng zawngte chuan, Lalpa an Pathian aw leh Lalpa an Pathianin a tirh anga zâwlnei Hagaia thu chu an bengkhawn ta a; mite chuan Lalpa chu a hmai hmaah chuan an ṭih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, mite hnêna Lalpa thuchah hmang chuan Lalpa tirhkoh Hagaia chuan a sawi a, “In hnênah ka awm a ni, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Sealtiela fapa, Judai ram awptu Zerubabela rilru leh Jehozadaka fapa, puithiam lalber Josua rilru leh mi la awm chhun zawng zawngte rilru chu a chawk tho ta a; tichuan, an lo kal a, Sipaihote Lalpa an Pathian inah chuan hna an thawk ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal Daria lal kum hnihna, a thla rukna, chumi thla ni sawmhnih leh ni linaah chuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla sarihna, chumi thla ni sawmhnih leh ni khatnaah zâwlnei Hagaia kutah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sealtiela fapa, Judai ram awptu Zerubabela hnênah leh Jehozadaka fapa, puithiam lalber Josua hnênah leh mi la awm chhunte hnênah chuan heti hian sawi ta che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘He in hi a hmaa a ropui lai hmu in zîngah tu nge la awm? Tûnah hian eng angin nge in hmuh le? In mit hmuhah eng tham mah a ni lo lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Zerubabel, tûnah chuan huai takin awm rawh,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; ‘Aw puithiam lalber Josua, Jehozadaka fapa, nang pawh chak takin awm rawh; tin, nangni he rama mi zawng zawngte u, chak takin awm bawk rawh u,’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; ‘Thawk rawh u, in hnênah ka awm si a,’ tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Aigupta ram aṭanga in lo chhuah laia thu ka thlunpui che u ang khân in zîngah ka thlarau a la chêng reng a ni, hlau suh u.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si a, ‘Hun rei lo tê-ah vawi khat chu vân leh lei leh tuifinriat leh khawmualte hi ka la tinghîng leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnam tinrêng ka tinghîng ang a, hnam tinrêng thil duh zâwngte chu a lo thleng ang a, he in hi ropuinain ka tikhat ang,’ Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Tangkarua hi ka ta a ni a, rangkachak hi ka ta a ni,’ tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘He in hnuhnûng zâwk ropuina hi a hmasa ai khân a nasa zâwk ang,’ Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti. ‘Tin, he hmunah hian remna ka thlen ang,’ tih hi Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Daria lal kum hnihna, thla kuana, ni sawmhnih leh ni linaah chuan zâwlnei Hagaia kutah Lalpa thu hetiang hian a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Puithiamte chu heti hian dân zâwt teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin emaw a kawrfual hmâwrah sa thianghlim fûn sela, a kawrfual hmâwr chuan chhang emaw, thil chhum kawi emaw, uain emaw, hriak emaw, ei tûr rêng rêng emaw lo khawih ta sela, a thianghlim ang em?” tiin. Puithiamte chuan, “Thianghlim lo vang,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Hagaia chuan, “Mitthi ruang khawih avânga mi bawrhbângin hêng thil a enga pawh hi lo khawih ta sela, a bawrhbâng ang em?” a ti a. Puithiamte chuan, “Bawrhbâng ang,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Hagaia chuan heti hian a chhâng ta a: “He mite hi chutiang tak chu an ni a, he hnam hi chutiang tak chuan ka hmaah an awm, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni; an kutchhuak tinrêng pawh chutiang bawk chu a ni a, chuta an thilhlan pawh chu a thianghlim lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûn aṭangin nakin hnu thlengin Lalpa biak inah lung in chherchhuan hma, tûn hma lam kha ngaihtuah ang che u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />khâng hun lai zawng zawng khân, buh tehkhâwng sawmhnih tling âwm tak chhûn khâwmnaa mi a lo kalin, sâwm chauh a lo tling a; uain sâwrna hmuna bûr sawmnga thâl chhuah tuma a lo kalin, sawmhnih chauh a lo tling ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In thawh chhuah zawng zawngah rona te, ngêtna te leh rial tein ka hrem che u a; nimahsela, ka lam in hawi chuang lo, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He thla kuana, ni sawmhnih leh ni lina, vawiin aṭang hian nakin hnu thlengin, tûn hma lam kha ngaihtuah ang che u, Lalpa biak in lung phûm ni aṭang khân ngaihtuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A chi chu buh inah a la awm em ni? Grêp hrui te, theipui kûng te, pawmgranet te leh olive thing te chu a la rah lo; vawiin aṭang hian mal ka sâwm ang che u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu, chumi thla, ni sawmhnih leh ni linaah chuan Hagaia hnênah a lo thleng nawn leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Hetiang hian Judai ram awptu Zerubabela hnênah chuan sawi rawh: ‘Kei chuan lei leh vân ka la tinghîng ang; ram lalṭhutphahte chu ka paih thla ang a, hnamte ram chakna chu ka tichhia ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tawlailîrte leh a chunga chuangte chu ka titlu ang a, sakawrte leh a chunga chuangte chu; mi tin mahni unaute khandaihin an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan, aw Zerubabel ka chhiahhlawh, Sealtiela fapa, ka chelh ang che,’ Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti, ‘Tin, hming nemna zungbun angah ka siam bawk ang che, ka lo thlang tawh si che a,’ Sipaihote Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti,” tiin.
  </para>
</usx>
